translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_c4d8f0f2:

    # principal " \"Why would we have this?\""
    principal "「我们为什么要有这个？」"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1064
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_88eb129c:

    # principal "It's simply just to help. We have to \"Get down with the kids\" and whatnot." id D2_Morgana_Swim_88eb129c
    principal "这纯粹是为了提供帮助而已。我们得「跟上年轻人的节奏」之类的。" id D2_Morgana_Swim_88eb129c

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1066
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_5ce622b8:

    # principal "Anyway, chit-chat isn't my forté, and I'd like to get onto why I called for you in the first place..."
    principal "不管怎样，我不擅长闲聊，还是先说正事吧，说说我一开始叫你来的原因……"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1067
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1069
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_e2d31e62:

    # mcT "I wonder what this could be about. I've only just started and the atmosphere in the room has turned a little... Ambiguous..."
    mcT "不知道这是要做什么。我才刚来，可这屋里的气氛已经有点……暧昧不清了……"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1071
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_51fdc7f9:

    # principal "I've been contacted by Sinergy."
    principal "星聚能那边联系我了。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1072
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_b45e265c:

    # principal "You remember them? Or do I have to go over who they are again?"
    principal "你还记得他们吧？还是说我得再给你讲讲他们是谁？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1079
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_353ddcb2:

    # principal "Right. But this will be the last time I repeat myself, are we clear?"
    principal "好吧。但这是我最后一次重复说明了，清楚了吗？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1081
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_84d9991b:

    # mc "Yes..."
    mc "是的……"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1082
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_86a83b14:

    # mcT "{size=-5}Bitch.{/size}"
    mcT "{size=-5}婊子。{/size}"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1084
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_31b5d7ad:

    # principal "Sinergy. They provide us with {b}a lot{/b} of money to make this institute the best it can be." id D2_Morgana_Swim_31b5d7ad
    principal "星聚能。他们给我们提供了{b}大量{/b}的资金，让我们的学校成为最好的学校。" id D2_Morgana_Swim_31b5d7ad

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1085
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_260da5d4:

    # principal "They are trying out a new form of education. One you might not be familiar with but we will go over it in the induction, but I can tell you a little now..."
    principal "他们正在尝试一种新的教育形式。可能你不太熟悉，入职培训时我们会详细讲解，但我现在可以先透露一点……"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1086
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_447e628e:

    # principal "This new systematic approach is to \"separate\" the students in the institute. We have boys in one end, and girls in this side of the institute." id D2_Morgana_Swim_447e628e
    principal "这套全新的教育体系，是要把学院里的学生「分开」管理。男生在学院那头，女生在这一头。" id D2_Morgana_Swim_447e628e

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1087
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_f6062aa3:

    # principal "This also includes the staff which is why my office is here, on this side. However you're an odd-ball. You see; Sinergy are interested to know how a male teacher will influence the female students."
    principal "这也包括教职员工，所以我的办公室才设在这边。不过你是个例外——星聚能很想知道，一名男教师会对女学生产生怎样的影响。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1089
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_4cbabfaa:

    # principal "Will a male teacher influence the girls to get their grades up? Will their exam scores sky-rocket? That's all on you."
    principal "男教师能促使女生提高成绩吗？她们的考试分数会大幅提升吗？这全看你了。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1090
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_79071a77:

    # principal "I'm sorry I'm being blunt about this, but yes, currently you're being tested to make sure this new way of learning will work."
    principal "很抱歉我说话这么直接，但没错，目前你正处于测试阶段，以此验证这种新学习模式是否可行。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1092
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_952a8a82:

    # principal "So I hope I've hired the right person for the job, and I've not scared you away already, for the second time."
    principal "所以，希望我没选错人，也希望这次不会第二次把你吓跑。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1094
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_bb3280f4:

    # mc "Seems logical to me so far... Since the college is getting all this money, is that why my pay-packet is larger than anywhere else in the country?" id D2_Morgana_Swim_bb3280f4
    mc "目前来看，这对我来说挺合理的……既然学院拿到这么多钱，这就是我工资比国内其他地方都高的原因吗？" id D2_Morgana_Swim_bb3280f4

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1095
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_6560f3fd:

    # principal "Yes absolutely. Your salary is based on the unknowns of the job. While you are primarily a teacher, you may be required to do other things around the institute too. and potentially report to Sinergy directly." id D2_Morgana_Swim_6560f3fd
    principal "完全正确。你的薪资是按这份工作的不确定性来定的。虽然你的主要职责是教学，但你可能也需要在学院里做些别的事，甚至有可能直接向星聚能汇报。" id D2_Morgana_Swim_6560f3fd

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1098
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_05aedf53:

    # principal "Good. I knew I picked the right person for the job."
    principal "很好。我就知道我没看错人。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1099
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_8fcfed4a:

    # mc "Thank-"
    mc "多谢——"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1102
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_a3dd3822:

    # principal "They want to meet you."
    principal "他们想见见你。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1103
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_c9b8b48d:

    # principal "Right now."
    principal "现在。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1106
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_7e991901:

    # mc "Oh, ok... But what about lessons?"
    mc "哦，好……那课程怎么办？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1107
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_c9797263:

    # mc "I can't just abandon them, especially on my second day."
    mc "我不能就这么扔下学生不管，尤其今天才是我入职第 2 天。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1109
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_a5b96ccf:

    # principal "Do not worry. [aiko], [mel], [ver] and recently [nurse] will batten the hatches while you're away. Just like it was before you arrived."
    principal "别担心。你不在的时候，[aiko]、[mel]、[ver]和最近才入职的[nurse]会处理各项事务。就和你没来之前一样。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1110
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_5713bdd7:

    # principal "There is a car waiting for you outside. You have 10 minutes before you need to leave. So button up any loose ends you have and go for a ride." id D2_Morgana_Swim_5713bdd7
    principal "外面有车在等你。你有 10 分钟时间，然后就该出发了。把手头没处理完的事收个尾，就上车吧。" id D2_Morgana_Swim_5713bdd7

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1111
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_a319830f:

    # principal "I have no idea who you'll meet from Sinergy. But please do try make a good first impression. We run on their funding, and I really don't want you to mess it up for us, or me."
    principal "我不知道你会见到星聚能的哪几位。但请务必留下好印象。我们整个学院都靠他们出资，我实在不想你把事情搞砸，砸到我们头上。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1113
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_b0607a27:

    # mcT "Well this is sudden..."
    mcT "这……来得也太突然了。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1114
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_4d527211:

    # mcT "And serious. How bad could it be?"
    mcT "而且事情还挺严重。能有多糟糕？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1115
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_8c41e7cc:

    # mcT "I'm not totally sure about leaving the students behind. They need a teacher, but I'll trust [principal]. I have no reason not to."
    mcT "我不太确定就这么丢下学生是否妥当。他们需要老师，但我相信[principal]。我没理由不信她。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1116
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_43282085:

    # mc "Ten minutes you say? Thats not a lot of time."
    mc "你说十分钟？这时间可不宽裕。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1118
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_03553510:

    # principal "If I could give you more, I would. But this is important and it needs to be done now. So, please leave and get ready. The car will not wait for you."
    principal "要是能多给你点时间，我肯定会的。但这事很重要，必须现在处理。所以，赶紧去准备吧。车不会等你的。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1120
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_53b915f8:

    # mc "Right, right. See you later [principal]. I'll let you know what happens."
    mc "行吧。回头见，[principal]。我会告诉你情况的。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1122
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_d9743d39:

    # principal "Please do. See you for late afternoon classes."
    principal "一定。下午的课上见。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1127
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_7f2532e3:

    # mcT "Right, better go check on [morg] quickly. See how she's doing."
    mcT "对了，我得赶紧去看看[morg]，瞧瞧她怎么样了。"

