translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_88d2f4a6:

    # nurse "You brought me a test-- patient, like we agreed on."
    nurse "就像我们之前说好的，你给我带来了一个试验对象。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1203
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_8201a818:

    # mc "Hmm... I did do that, didn't I? I didn't think much of it..." id D2_Morgana_Swim_8201a818
    mc "嗯……我确实这么做了，对吧？我之前没想那么多……" id D2_Morgana_Swim_8201a818

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1204
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_65461567:

    # mc "Soo... I mean she looks fine to me?"
    mc "所以……我是说，在我看来她状态挺好的？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1205
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_5f73dc70:

    # mcT "Apart from the purple eyes..."
    mcT "除了那双紫色的眼睛……"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1206
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_04ba50c3:

    # mc "What did you do?"
    mc "你究竟做了什么？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1208
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_5b6f750f:

    # nurse "How do I put this..."
    nurse "这该怎么说呢……"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1210
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_65b0b68b:

    # nurse "Well... It seems the meds I made and gave her for the pain had... an adverse effect..."
    nurse "嗯……看来我给她止痛用的药，产生了……反效果。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1211
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_6fa3be87:

    # nurse "You know how it is, every medication has side effects. I told little ole' [morg] here the side effects, and she agreed to take them."
    nurse "你知道的，每种药都有副作用。我已经把副作用都告诉小[morg]了，她也同意服用。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1212
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_a83accac:

    # nurse "It turns out with the limited testing so far, she's sort of like... more agreeable..?"
    nurse "结果呢，就目前有限的测试来看，她似乎变得……更顺从了？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1213
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_1654b4d2:

    # nurse "She'll listen to you, {i}and only you,{/i} and will do things that she would already have wanted to do."
    nurse "她会听你的话，{i}而且只听你的{/i}，并且会去做那些她本来就想做的事。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1214
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_1733847b:

    # nurse "But because of social norms and anxiety, she suppresses." id D2_Morgana_Swim_1733847b
    nurse "但由于社会规范和自身焦虑，她一直压抑着。" id D2_Morgana_Swim_1733847b

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1215
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_2fa1e712:

    # nurse "But if you tell her to do something she wouldn't already be wanting to do, she won't do it!"
    nurse "但要是你让她做些本来就不想做的事，她可不会照做！"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1216
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_5e3fe741:

    # nurse "And... she'll probably slap you. *Giggles Menacingly*"
    nurse "而且……她多半会给你一巴掌。*阴森森地笑起来*"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1218
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Swim_f6bf9a56:

    # nurse "Example:"
    nurse "比如："

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1220
