    # ella "I'm sure you're aware that you're the only male teacher on the girls' side of the college right?" id D2_Morgana_Nurse_ff6230d5
    ella "我想你肯定清楚，你是这所学院女生部唯一的男教师，对吧？" id D2_Morgana_Nurse_ff6230d5

