translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_e34eb3e6:

    # ella "We support many colleges across the nation, could you remind me of the college's name?" id D2_Morgana_Nurse_e34eb3e6
    ella "我们在全国范围内支持很多学院，你能提醒我一下这所学院的名字吗？" id D2_Morgana_Nurse_e34eb3e6

