translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_89ce6d4d:

    # ella "Most locks are off, and one specific teacher is chosen to pick up that mantle."
    ella "大多数限制已解除，而且选定了一位特定的老师来承担这一重任。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1728
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_4b58becd:

    # ella "And would you look at that. {i}That{/i} new teacher is sitting right in front of me."
    ella "瞧瞧，那位{i}新{/i}老师不就正坐在我面前嘛。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1729
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_184247b7:

    # ella "Would you like to know what you can and can't do right now?"
    ella "你想知道什么能做，什么不能做吗？"

