    ella "嗯。{b}惩罚与奖励交换。{/b}"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1741
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_86120832:

    # mc "Interesting naming. Can you tell me what that actually means?"
    mc "这名字挺有意思。你能说说它到底是什么意思吗？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1743
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_6e3efc08:

    # ella "Absolutely."
    ella "当然可以。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1745
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_2bf41261:

    # ella "Of course in any school, some form of punishment is required in order to keep the students on the straight and narrow, right?"
    ella "当然，在任何学校，为了让学生遵守规矩，都需要某种形式的惩罚，对吧？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1747
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_f800bed0:

    # mc "Yes."
    mc "是的。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1749
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_07b07240:

    # ella "You will have full control of punishment."
    ella "你将全权掌控惩罚。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1751
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_eeec133c:

    # ella "Whether it be standard detention, or more... harsh punishments."
    ella "无论是常规的留堂，还是更为……严厉的惩罚。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1752
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_2399f696:

    # ella "The same for rewards. If a student has been particularly good, you may reward them. Reward their good behaviour."
    ella "奖励也是同理。要是某个学生表现特别出彩，你可以给她奖励，嘉许她的良好表现。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1754
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_20ec901e:

    # ella "There are no rules on what constitutes as a punishment or a reward. We're giving you a lot of leeway."
    ella "关于怎样算是惩罚或奖励，没有规则规定。我们给你很大的发挥空间。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1755
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_1fd00f93:

    # ella "They could also intertwine. It's all up to you. We won't get in your way. In fact, we'll support you."
    ella "惩罚和奖励也可以相互结合。一切都由你决定。我们不会妨碍你。事实上，我们会支持你。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1757
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_f93a324e:

    # mcT "Soo... I could do anything I want?..."
    mcT "所以……我可以随心所欲地做任何事？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1758
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_ea45a5e8:

    # mcT "In a college full of girls, girls who often misbehave..." id D2_Morgana_Nurse_ea45a5e8
    mcT "在一所全是女生的学院里，而这些女生还经常调皮捣蛋……" id D2_Morgana_Nurse_ea45a5e8

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1760
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_7f313fc1:

    # mc "Sorry, just to clarify, so when you say I'm in full control of how the students are punished, you mean {i}full{/i} control of how students are punished?"
    mc "不好意思，我确认一下——你说学生的惩罚方式全由我决定，是指{i}绝对{/i}全权由我定？"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1762
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_353c9978:

    # ella "Yep! We're interested to see what kind of results you yield. The issue with restrictive disciplinary systems is that students will eventually learn what they can and can't get away with."
    ella "没错！我们迫不及待想看看你能做出什么成绩。纪律制度一旦把规矩定死，弊端就在于学生迟早会摸清哪些事做了不会被追究。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1764
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_c8639250:

    # ella "By giving you total free reign, we're hoping that their thinking will turn away from pushing the limits of what they can get away with, because the limits of what you can do, will always be higher."
    ella "给你完全自由的处置权，就是希望学生们的想法能转变过来，不再一门心思琢磨怎么钻空子——因为你能用来对付他们的手段，永远比他们能想象的更多。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1765
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_e45c2683:

    # ella "Though as with anything, you have your own limits."
    ella "不过，和任何事一样，你也有自己的限制。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1767
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_6f1a3e47:

    # mc "Ahh, I figured that might be the case."
    mc "啊，我就猜到可能是这样。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1769
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_356d0aca:

    # ella "Simply put, don't do anything illegal. We will support you, but we can't have you just going around raping the students for example. That's a no go."
    ella "简而言之，别触犯法律。我们会全力支持你，但像强奸学生这种事，绝不能做。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1771
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_ac73cdd7:

    # ella "But I'm sure you have more morals than that. So we needn't worry."
    ella "不过我确信你的道德底线比这高得多，就不用担心了。"

# game/Days/dayTwo.rpy:1773
translate chinese D2_Morgana_Nurse_6ba80dfd:

    # ella "We're nearly at the end of the show, please take this on your way out."
